# Build context hygiene: never ship secrets or local state into an image, and
# never let a host-built artifact shadow what the build stage compiles.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/
dist/
web/dist/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

.git/
.github/
.agent/
.codex/
.claude/

tests/
docs/
deploy/
scripts/
skills/
*.md
!README.md

npm-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
